esses entered into the system conform with the pattern [username]@contoso.edu. Hint: Refer to the regex material in the Galloway book.   Use data attributes to insure that Gpa is expressed as a value in range from 0.7 and 4.0 inclusive.   The Students (Index) view should be sortable ascending and descending according to the LastName column or the GPA column. ","topics":[],"score":213869,"global_rank":253563},{"name":"samanthaberk/my-travel-template","owner":"samanthaberk","html_url":"https://github.com/samanthaberk/my-travel-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Front-end ReactJS app for Ada C9 Capstone project- My Travel Template","topics":[],"score":213867,"global_rank":253564},{"name":"fantapop/dateTime-bug-repro","owner":"fantapop","html_url":"https://github.com/fantapop/dateTime-bug-repro","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213867,"global_rank":253565},{"name":"shuai-zh/gatsby-starter-netlify-cms","owner":"shuai-zh","html_url":"https://github.com/shuai-zh/gatsby-starter-netlify-cms","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":2,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213867,"global_rank":253566},{"name":"satheaki/Developer-Profiler","owner":"satheaki","html_url":"https://github.com/satheaki/Developer-Profiler","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"A MERN(Mongo,Express,React,Node) social network application for developers/QA's/Architects","topics":[],"score":213867,"global_rank":253571},{"name":"yoscheherazade/hero-jabbr","owner":"yoscheherazade","html_url":"https://github.com/yoscheherazade/hero-jabbr","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"a social networking app, a la Twitter, for superheroes (and villians, of course!).","topics":[],"score":213867,"global_rank":253572},{"name":"jeremybwilson/codingdojo_bootcamp","owner":"jerem